  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/IMG_3712.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Com cada primer diumenge de mes, s&#39;ha celebrat una nova edici&oacute; de Suera Obert Museu (SOM), organitzada pel Centre Cultural i dedicada en aquesta ocasi&oacute; a la matan&ccedil;a del porc. S&#39;ha complementat amb les parades del Comerciants de Sueras, tamb&eacute; a la pla&ccedil;a.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/matancaporcsomdeeembre/img_3677.jpg\" alt=\"img_3677\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/matancaporcsomdeeembre/img_3678.jpg\" alt=\"img_3678\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/matancaporcsomdeeembre/img_3679.jpg\" alt=\"img_3679\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/matancaporcsomdeeembre/img_3680.jpg\" alt=\"img_3680\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/matancaporcsomdeeembre/img_3681.jpg\" alt=\"img_3681\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/matancaporcsomdeeembre/img_3682.jpg\" alt=\"img_3682\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/matancaporcsomdeeembre/img_3683.jpg\" alt=\"img_3683\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/matancaporcsomdeeembre/img_3684.jpg\" alt=\"img_3684\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/matancaporcsomdeeembre/img_3686.jpg\" alt=\"img_3686\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f